{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This pack is the second 3D model resource pack based on the &quot;SMILE Characters Vol. 1&quot; DLC for SMILE GAME BUILDER, with blend shapes and motions added by LastSmile for RPG Developer Bakin, and greatly enhanced. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In addition to character models, this version includes a variety of additional elements, such as the &quot;Slipper,&quot; a vehicle originally designed by LastSmile that races through the desert, a majestic towering pyramid, bones of giant creatures on a grand scale, a vast desert terrain model, and even particle effects that give a realistic feel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take advantage of this voluminous pack, filled with a wealth of content, to add even more depth and intensity to your game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[SMILE Characters DX Vol.2] Contents</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">--- 3D Model Details ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Characters</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hero Characters: 3 types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Heroine Characters: 3 types</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Vehicle: 1</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Animated Facial Expressions: 7 different facial expressions with blend shapes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Motions: 71 types (covering movement, combat, standby poses, etc.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Map Objects: 20</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Particle Effects: \uff17</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Sample Maps: 6</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">---2D Assets Details ---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Standing Portraits: 6 figures, 4 different facial expressions</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3545860?t=1742947836","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3545860?t=1742947836","capsule_image":"https